          "argsRaw": "{\"message\":\"Incident resolved: pricing-api latency and CPU returned to normal after scaling up and restoring price-cache. Root cause: price-cache was stuck and serving no keys, causing 100% cache misses and overload on pricing-api during high traffic.\"}"
