      "turn": 31,
      "response": {
        "text": "Root cause: The price-cache service was stuck in a loading state after a failed snapshot restore, resulting in 100% cache misses. This forced pricing-api to compute all prices from the catalog under flash sale traffic, overloading its CPU and increasing latency.\n\nAction taken: Scaled pricing-api to 6 replicas (per runbook for sales) and restarted price-cache, restoring cache hit ratio and normalizing pricing-api latency and CPU.\n\nAffected service: pricing-api (impacted by price-cache failure).",
